{"4036720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Scropia", "steam_appid": 4036720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How hard can it be to retire on a dying planet? The future has been torn to shreds by those who hold it in their hydraulic claws.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scropia is a story-driven visual novel set on a planet colonized by mechanical life forms, featuring mini-games. This civilization, which briefly introduces itself as the Federation and rules nearly the entire planet with an iron fist, is rapidly approaching its end due to never-ending wars with biological life forms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scropia's story begins when the bot named Mether wakes up while being transported to a place called “paradise” for retirees via a kind of cable car line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices will shape your destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036720/extras/f4a4d2303633a80c5e72ea937bef9168.avif?t=1784228763\" alt=\"\"width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><strong>Game Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ Interaction: You must make vital choices in difficult situations and pass the interrogations of both government officials and rebels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ Puzzles: There are many secrets about the characters and the universe. It is your task to find and solve them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ Mini-Games and Extras: This game offers mini-games, extra content, and alternative endings for players seeking variety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\